@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Terms & Conditions";
}

<div class="legal-page">

    <div class="legal-header">
        <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("d MMMM yyyy")</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-notice">
        <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill"></i>
        <p>
            Umbilo Rentals is a student project. These terms describe how the
            platform is intended to work, but this is not a substitute for a
            legally reviewed rental agreement.
        </p>
    </div>

    <section>
        <h2>1. Acceptance of these terms</h2>
        <p>
            By creating an account or using Umbilo Rentals, you agree to these
            terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the platform.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>2. Using the platform</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>You must provide accurate information when registering and applying for a room.</li>
            <li>You are responsible for keeping your account login details confidential.</li>
            <li>You must not use the platform for any unlawful purpose or to submit false applications.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>3. Applications</h2>
        <p>
            Submitting a room application through the platform does not guarantee
            accommodation. Applications are reviewed and may be approved or
            rejected. Room availability, pricing and status shown on the platform
            are updated by administrators and may change.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>4. Payments</h2>
        <p>
            Payments are processed through PayFast, a third-party payment gateway.
            By making a payment, you also agree to PayFast's own terms of service.
            Umbilo Rentals is not responsible for issues arising from PayFast's
            processing of your payment.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>5. Maintenance requests</h2>
        <p>
            Maintenance requests submitted through the platform are logged and
            tracked, but response times are not guaranteed within these terms.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>6. Account suspension</h2>
        <p>
            We may suspend or terminate an account that provides false information,
            misuses the platform, or violates these terms.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
            As a student project, Umbilo Rentals is provided "as is" without
            warranties of any kind. We do our best to keep information accurate
            and the platform available, but we are not liable for losses arising
            from use of the platform, technical errors, or downtime.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>8. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>
            We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the
            platform after a change means you accept the updated terms.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>9. Contact</h2>
        <p>
            Questions about these terms can be sent to
            <a href="mailto:info@umbilorentals.co.za">info@umbilorentals.co.za</a>.
        </p>
    </section>

</div>
